86b579fce1260992.jpg", "year": "2026", "area": "中国大陆", "actor": "徐晨皓＆张星伊", "director": "", "content": "", "episodes": [{"name": "全集", "url": "https://v12.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv12/202605/05/Ah4nAEiBdq88/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_3f373f3146_part6.json"}, {"id": 5366, "title": "玉罗刹", "category": "古装仙侠", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20260505-1/cdcbe8d821964fe05ee2d522178c300f.jpg", "year": "1968", "area": "中国香港", "actor": "郑佩佩,谷峰,唐菁,樊梅生", "director": "何梦华", "content": "<p>每当夜晚有女人的歌声响起，就意味着有人被杀，第二天就会有许多人头挂在街上。杀人者叫“玉罗刹”，专杀姓阎的人。客栈里，侠客徐英豪要去找仇人石勇山报杀父之仇，偶遇化名冷秋寒的玉罗刹，徐英豪问他为何杀尽阎家人，玉罗刹回答说：阎家兄弟20人中不知是谁杀了我的全家，但总有一个是。二人分手后，徐英豪来到石家庄，一醉汉自称石勇山，徐英豪举斧就砍，醉汉当场毙命，众乡亲闻声赶来，告诉英豪杀错人了，真正的石勇山早已搬走，英豪发誓从此封剑。</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "HD", "url": "https://v5.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv5/202404/20/ZqmLBJ8j9x77/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "全集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202605/05/c9aBz49G1G91/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_3f373f3146_part6.json"}, {"id": 158932, "title": "宗门都是女弟子，系统让我无敌了", "category": "古装仙侠", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20260504-1/460126ea0a17f9993a286d2c1c47dedf.jpg", "year": "2026", "area": "中国大陆", "actor": "聂杨&甜橙", "director": "", "content": "", "episodes": [{"name": "全集", "url": "https://v8.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv8/202605/03/zE8sqLKZna86/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_3f373f3146_part6.json"}, {"id": 158920, "title": "这个杀手有点穷", "category": "古装仙侠", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20260504-1/fd1cf4da6eabefdf04603abd552774ef.jpg", "year": "2026", "area": "中国大陆", "actor": "李卿儿＆郭昊钧", "director": "", "content": "", "episodes": [{"name": "全集", "url": "https://v1.wujinwsym3u8.com/202605/03/Cwb9bYXSA091/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_3f373f3146_part6.json"}, {"id": 158915, "title": "休夫后，我换嫁纨绔照样当主母", "category": "古装仙侠", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20260504-1/46c428f6df28777fef22ff704c31938b.jpg", "year": "2026", "area": "中国大陆", "actor": "程宇峰＆高明君", "director": "", "content": "", "e